---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Akash Popat — Senior Product Designer. About, experience, education and skills."
>
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Akash Popat - Designer</h1>
    <p class="contact-info">
      Bangalore, India | Remote in PST timezones | akash.popat27@gmail.com
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <p>
        A UX and product designer with 10+ years of experience designing
        enterprise experiences that help people make sense of complexity.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Professional Experience</h2>
      <div class="job">
        <h3>Full-Stack UX Design Associate</h3>
        <p class="job-details">
          SAP, Digital Experience team | April 2021 – September 2025 | remote-hybrid
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Led design strategy for SAP's eCommerce platform, standardizing
            2,000+ partner pages to boost credibility and engagement—driving a
            50% rise in PDP traffic, 10% more leads, and 20% more partner
            extension purchases.
          </li>
          <li>
            Led a comprehensive B2B eCommerce analysis, using heuristics,
            task-flow audits, and user interviews to identify checkout friction;
            proposed a redesigned flow that eased cognitive load, improved
            conversions, and aligned strategy across teams.
          </li>
          <li>
            Designed and shipped private offer capability on complex systems,
            integrating customers, partners, and SAP sales to enable flexible
            purchasing, boost adoption, and drive measurable revenue.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="job">
        <h3>Senior UX design specialist</h3>
        <p class="job-details">
          SAP, Fiori Design System team | September 2020 - March 2021 | Remote -
          hybrid
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Conducted comprehensive research on design system portal usage and
            proposed a new information architecture to improve discoverability,
            adoption, and usability across internal teams.
          </li>
          <li>
            Designed an end-to-end embedded AI dictation feature for mobile
            apps, investigating use cases with app teams and creating flexible
            components to enable broad adoption.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="job">
        <h3>Senior visual designer</h3>
        <p class="job-details">Lollipop design studio | Full-time | 2017 - 2020</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Product Designer on a variety of projects from small startups to
            large companies. During my time in the company, I worked with
            stakeholders, engineers and product managers on implementing new
            features, redesigning outdated UX experiences and creating an
            appealing visual appearance of the product.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="job">
        <h3>Freelance Multidisciplinary Designer</h3>
        <p class="job-details">2020 - 2025</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            As a freelancer, my work is of a full-stack designer, whether
            designing entire websites or creating specific components,
            independently or as part of a team. I have worked with growing
            companies as a contractor on product design, web design, and
            visuals.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="job">
        <h3>UX Designer, Websites</h3>
        <p class="job-details">National Instruments | 2015 - 2017</p>
      </div>
      <div class="job">
        <h3>UX design intern</h3>
        <p class="job-details">National Instruments | 2014-2015</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <p>
        I have a Bachelor's of Engineering (B.E) degree in Electrical
        Engineering.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <div class="skills-container">
        <div>
          <h3>Creative Coding</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Front-end Experimentation (HTML/CSS/ Tailwind CSS)</li>
            <li>AI-assisted Prototyping</li>
            <li>Prompt Engineering</li>
            <li>
              Generative Design with AI Tools: Github Copilot, Cursor, V0 by
              Vercel, Gemini CLI, Qwen CLI, Claude Code, Figma Make
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Tools</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Figma</li>
            <li>Adobe XD</li>
            <li>Sketch</li>
            <li>Adobe Photoshop</li>
            <li>Adobe Illustrator</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
